        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.21,
          "end": 132.373,
          "en": "from Unsplash, if you wanna use it in your app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.23,
          "end": 137.09,
          "en": "So now with the image stored in the assets images folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.09,
          "end": 139.05,
          "en": "we should point at it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.05,
          "end": 141.95,
          "en": "And just as with the normal image component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.95,
          "end": 145.34,
          "en": "we don't just pass a path as a string here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.34,
          "end": 148.3,
          "en": "instead, we use this special require function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.3,
          "end": 151.203,
          "en": "and to then construct a path to the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.59,
          "end": 154.29,
          "en": "Now, here I'm in app JS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.29,
          "end": 157.16,
          "en": "So I don't need to go up one level first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.16,
          "end": 160.5,
          "en": "Instead, I am already next to the assets folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.5,
          "end": 165.07999999999998,
          "en": "So with dot slash, we tell react native that we're looking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.07999999999998,
          "end": 169.42000000000002,
          "en": "for a folder that's in the same folder as this app JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.42000000000002,
          "end": 172.27,
          "en": "And then it's the assets folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.27,
          "end": 174.42000000000002,
          "en": "there, the images folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.42000000000002,
          "end": 178.483,
          "en": "and in there, the background PNG file like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 179.7,
          "end": 182.7,
          "en": "Now image background also takes another prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 182.7,
          "end": 184.04,
          "en": "which is very important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.04,
          "end": 185.823,
          "en": "And that's the resize mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 186.95,
          "end": 189.91,
          "en": "It's very likely that the image you're using is too small",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.91,
          "end": 192.57,
          "en": "or too big for the screen size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 192.57,
          "end": 194.89,
          "en": "of the device on which the app is running.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.89,
          "end": 198.32999999999998,
          "en": "And resize mode controls how the image will be resized",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.32999999999998,
          "end": 200.86,
          "en": "if it doesn't have this same dimensions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.86,
          "end": 202.623,
          "en": "as the underlying device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.93,
          "end": 205.73,
          "en": "Here, you got multiple options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.73,
          "end": 208.31,
          "en": "which you might know from web development",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.31,
          "end": 210.52,
          "en": "because there you have similar options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.52,
          "end": 211.85,
          "en": "when working with images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.85,
          "end": 214.01,
          "en": "with background images to be precise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.85,
          "end": 217.18,
          "en": "and I will use cover, which will make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.18,
          "end": 220.75,
          "en": "that the image always covers up all the available space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.75,
          "end": 225.173,
          "en": "but not by distorting it, but instead by zooming in or out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 226.1,
          "end": 228.04,
          "en": "So that's a nice setting when it comes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.04,
          "end": 230.183,
          "en": "to adjusting the size of the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.95,
          "end": 233.28,
          "en": "Now what's also important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 237.21,
          "en": "is that I will add the style prop to image background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.21,
          "end": 239.66,
          "en": "And here I also will point at a root screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.66,
          "end": 243.29,
          "en": "so that this also takes up all the available space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 243.29,
          "end": 245.82,
          "en": "It's not enough that the gradient does this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 245.82,
          "end": 247.71,
          "en": "This image should also take",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.71,
          "end": 250.97,
          "en": "up all the available space that is made available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 250.97,
          "end": 252.72,
          "en": "by its parent component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.72,
          "end": 255.053,
          "en": "So by the gradient, in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.55,
          "end": 258.02,
          "en": "If you now save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.02,
          "end": 262.39,
          "en": "here's the image, but the gradient is gone.",
