        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.577,
          "end": 266.68,
          "en": "And in that case, this perfect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 266.68,
          "end": 269.26,
          "en": "But if you also want the gradient back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.26,
          "end": 272.89,
          "en": "we now have to make this image transparent.",
