        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 317.67,
          "end": 319.96,
          "en": "you will see how that works internally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 319.96,
          "end": 321.6,
          "en": "And you will see that it's a combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 321.6,
          "end": 325.313,
          "en": "of a view and the normal image component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 326.75,
          "end": 329.18,
          "en": "Now, the style which we set here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 329.18,
          "end": 332.463,
          "en": "this prop is added to this view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 333.45,
          "end": 336.5,
          "en": "We can see that here, the style is set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 336.5,
          "end": 339.87,
          "en": "The inner image can also receive some styling though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 339.87,
          "end": 344.12,
          "en": "And here on this inner image we wanna add some transparency",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 344.12,
          "end": 346.1,
          "en": "because the view is transparent anyways,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 346.1,
          "end": 348.95,
          "en": "it doesn't have a background color by default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 348.95,
          "end": 352.57,
          "en": "but of course the image, well shows the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 352.57,
          "end": 353.403,
          "en": "So therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 353.403,
          "end": 357.61,
          "en": "now we can add the background image style object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 358.52,
          "end": 363.17,
          "en": "and add the opacity property to give this image an opacity",
