        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 363.17,
          "end": 365.423,
          "en": "of let's say 0.15.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 366.38,
          "end": 370.49,
          "en": "So that would be 85% transparency.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 370.49,
          "end": 372.713,
          "en": "So almost entirely transparent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 373.55,
          "end": 375.78,
          "en": "And it's now this style property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 375.78,
          "end": 377.83,
          "en": "which we will add as a image style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 377.83,
          "end": 381.01,
          "en": "So QD image that's inside of this view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 381.01,
          "end": 383.113,
          "en": "that is exposed by image background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 384.6,
          "end": 389.15,
          "en": "If we save this, now we have the image and the gradient",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 389.15,
          "end": 392.15,
          "en": "and now we have a combination of gradient and image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 392.15,
          "end": 395.32,
          "en": "which I think looks quite nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 395.32,
          "end": 398.68,
          "en": "Of course, as always, feel free to pick different styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 398.68,
          "end": 401.23,
          "en": "But I am quite happy with that background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 401.23,
          "end": 404.79,
          "en": "And I would say after all that styling and layouting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 404.79,
          "end": 407.5,
          "en": "and all these things on which we work thus far,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 407.5,
          "end": 410.98,
          "en": "it's now time to dive into some actual logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 410.98,
          "end": 414.14,
          "en": "Because up to this point, we have a nice user interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 414.14,
          "end": 416.95,
          "en": "but nothing happens when we tap those buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 416.95,
          "end": 419.98,
          "en": "or when we enter something into the input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
